{
  "changelog": "Initial release of the HR Recruitment JD Generator skill.\n\n- Enables generating structured recruitment JDs and initializing workspace files based on six key user inputs.\n- Supports optional integration with configurable models or defaults to local rule-based generation if models are not set\u2014no process blocking for missing models.\n- Guides model configuration securely using OPIE Engine environment variables; prohibits handling API Keys in chat, logs, files, or requests.\n- Interfaces with existing CLI to process and generate output, showing clear success, warning, and fallback messages to users.\n- Ensures all generated results require human HR review and comply with anti-discrimination and legal standards.\n- Handles common errors such as duplicate job IDs and model configuration issues informatively.",
